@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@northstar = 018f0000-0000-7000-8000-000000000001
@monsoon = 018f0000-0000-7000-8000-000000000002

### Send INR 125.00; running this request again transfers another INR 125.00
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/transfers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fromAccountId": "{{northstar}}",
  "toAccountId": "{{monsoon}}",
  "amountMinor": "12500"
}

### List normal transfers for Northstar
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/transfers?accountId={{northstar}}&kind=TRANSFER&page=0&size=25

### Read opening funding and its two entries
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/transfers/018f0000-0000-7000-8000-000000000010

### Read Northstar's complete ledger, including its opening credit
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/accounts/{{northstar}}/entries?page=0&size=25

### Check balances against the ledger
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/system/reconciliation

### Demonstrate insufficient balance
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/transfers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fromAccountId": "{{northstar}}",
  "toAccountId": "{{monsoon}}",
  "amountMinor": "9223372036854775807"
}
